From: =?UTF-8?q?Barnab=C3=A1s=20P=C5=91cze?=
 <barnabas.pocze@ideasonboard.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:06:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/38] libcamera: controls: Fix `ColourTemperature` direction
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The control has been updated to be writable, but that change
failed to adjust the `direction` appropriately. So do that.

Fixes: 4d2618fb1096 ("libcamera: controls: Update the ColourTemperature control to be writable")
Signed-off-by: Barnabás Pőcze <barnabas.pocze@ideasonboard.com>
Reviewed-by: Kieran Bingham <kieran.bingham@ideasonboard.com>
Reviewed-by: Jacopo Mondi <jacopo.mondi@ideasonboard.com>

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://patchwork.libcamera.org/patch/28344/]

---
 src/libcamera/control_ids_core.yaml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/control_ids_core.yaml b/src/libcamera/control_ids_core.yaml
index 89991d03..e87c0bb1 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/control_ids_core.yaml
+++ b/src/libcamera/control_ids_core.yaml
@@ -598,7 +598,7 @@ controls:
 
   - ColourTemperature:
       type: int32_t
-      direction: out
+      direction: inout
       description: |
         ColourTemperature of the frame, in kelvin.
 
